I come across to you.

196
00:15:18,149 --> 00:15:20,359
-What? No, I mean it.
-[SIGHS]

197
00:15:20,443 --> 00:15:23,487
The… Your book, it…
it opened up the world for me.

198
00:15:25,573 --> 00:15:26,907
Mark, are you okay?

199
00:15:26,991 --> 00:15:30,995
Yes. This book changed my whole life.

200
00:15:31,954 --> 00:15:33,538
